# Tomik, Wielder of Law: "Whenever an opponent attacks": his controller attacking does not trigger him. Tomik (flying, vigilance) and
# Young Wolf attack Bot2, two creatures attacking Bot2: the stack stays empty, nobody loses extra life, nobody draws. Vigilance:
# Tomik is still untapped after attacking while Young Wolf is tapped. Flying: Bot2's Llanowar Elves (no flying or reach) cannot block
# him; Bot2 does not block, so it takes 2 + 1 = 3 damage.

